import Principia.Syntax.Ramified
import Principia.FirstEdition.Volume1.Star93Source

namespace PM.RamifiedSyntax

/-!
# Derived propositions of PM I, ✱93

The inductive and hereditary relation constructions in ✱93 reuse the
relation-valued ancestral operations of ✱90–✱92.  The current ramified
syntax represents relation abstraction only as an incomplete contextual
formula and provides no derived elimination rule turning it into the term
required by these applications.  No inexact surrogate is introduced, so no
`⊢ᵣ` theorem is declared.
-/

end PM.RamifiedSyntax
